      "wf.handoff1":"ELIF: \"This customer is investment-focused.\"","wf.handoff2":"HANDED OFF TO ZEYNEP","wf.handoff3":"ZEYNEP: presents 3 projects","wf.handoff4":"MEHMET: starts follow-up","wf.handoff5":"APPOINTMENT BOOKED",
      "compare.eyebrow":"CRM? CHATBOT?","compare.h2":"Neither.",
      "compare.old1":"A CRM records the customer.","compare.new1":"VERALIQ talks with your customer.",
      "compare.old2":"A chatbot answers a question.","compare.new2":"VERALIQ runs the sales process.",
      "compare.old3":"A CRM is a tool for the sales team.","compare.new3":"VERALIQ itself is your sales team.",
      "modules.eyebrow":"PRODUCT MODULES","modules.h2":"Your entire sales operation, on one platform.",
      "modules.p":"Each module is designed to work independently — activate it alone or together, based on your needs.",
      "modules.svc1Title":"AI Sales Agent","modules.svc1Desc":"A named digital sales rep trained specifically for your company.",
      "modules.svc2Title":"AI Lead Management","modules.svc2Desc":"Every incoming lead is automatically greeted, qualified and prioritized.",
      "modules.svc3Title":"AI Portfolio Matching","modules.svc3Desc":"Matches the right project/portfolio automatically based on the customer's budget and preferences.",
      "modules.svc4Title":"Voice & Video Interaction","modules.svc4Desc":"Real-time voice conversation — not a classic text-only chat experience.",
      "modules.svc5Title":"CRM Integration","modules.svc5Desc":"Connect your own CRM or use the built-in one — stock/pricing sync automatically.",
      "modules.svc6Title":"Automated Follow-up","modules.svc6Desc":"Gently reminds undecided customers and notes special dates.",
      "modules.svc7Title":"Sales Analytics","modules.svc7Desc":"Conversation, conversion and opportunity data reported in one panel.",
      "modules.svc8Title":"Agent Management","modules.svc8Desc":"Manage each Agent's name, role, voice and permissions from the admin panel.",
      "portal.eyebrow":"COMPANY PORTAL","portal.h2":"Your projects, sales and Agent performance in one panel.",
      "portal.p":"Your company's own portal is live — below is a simplified preview of its design language. Reach the real screens via \"Company Login.\"",
      "portal.note":"WHAT YOU'LL SEE",
      "portal.li1":"Project and portfolio management in one screen","portal.li2":"Live tracking of leads, appointments and the sales pipeline","portal.li3":"Agent performance and conversation analytics","portal.li4":"PDF/Excel reporting with your company's branding",
      "cc.eyebrow":"NEW · ENTERPRISE ADD-ON","cc.h2":"Never be caught off guard by regulation, seismic code, or material prices.","cc.p":"A decision-support layer for your construction and real-estate projects that tracks official regulations, Turkish seismic code (TBDY) updates, and steel/rebar prices every day. It never gives investment advice or a final legal opinion — it flags the relevant clause or data point and leaves the decision to you.","cc.li1":"Scans the Official Gazette and zoning regulations daily, flagging what matches your projects","cc.li2":"Alerts you the moment a TBDY (seismic code) update touches a relevant clause","cc.li3":"Tracks live prices for steel, rebar, and core construction materials","cc.li4":"Keeps your bureaucratic paperwork in one panel","cc.cta":"Let's Try This Module →","cc.note":"Pricing is shared once we've walked through the module together.",
      "portal.imgAlt":"VERALIQ company portal design preview",
      "results.eyebrow":"RESULTS","results.h2":"Not a promise — a measurable sales number.",
      "results.li1":"Faster lead response","results.li2":"Fewer lost customers","results.li3":"24/7 communication","results.li4":"More follow-ups","results.li5":"Less repetitive work","results.li6":"Higher sales opportunity","results.li7":"Lower operational load","results.li8":"Higher closing rate",
      "channels.eyebrow":"ONE TEAM, MULTIPLE CHANNELS","channels.h2":"The same team works everywhere.",
      "channels.p":"Built at the platform level — add it to your own website, portal or mobile app with a single line of code.",
      "channels.chip1":"veraliq.com","channels.chip2":"Company Website","channels.chip3":"Customer Portal","channels.chip4":"Admin Portal","channels.chip5":"Mobile App","channels.chip6":"Custom Landing Page","channels.chip7":"Project Website",
      "trust.eyebrow":"SECURITY & DATA","trust.h2":"Enterprise trust, simple infrastructure.",
      "trust.item1Title":"Company Data Isolation","trust.item1Desc":"Each company's project and customer data is kept separate; the Agent only ever talks with your own company's data.",
      "trust.item2Title":"Authorization","trust.item2Desc":"Admin, portal and CRM access is controlled with role-based authorization.",
      "trust.item3Title":"Data Protection Approach","trust.item3Desc":"Customer data is collected with explicit consent; a ready process exists for retention and deletion requests.",
      "trust.item4Title":"Auditable Access","trust.item4Desc":"Conversation and transaction logs are kept with timestamps and are auditable.",
      "faq.eyebrow":"FREQUENTLY ASKED QUESTIONS","faq.h2":"What people ask us.",
      "faq.q1":"What is VERALIQ?","faq.a1":"An AI Workforce platform where companies create, authorize and run their own digital employees. Its first use case is real estate and construction sales.",
      "faq.q2":"What is an AI Agent?","faq.a2":"A digital sales employee with a defined name, role, area of expertise and permissions, configured specifically for your company, able to speak in real time.",
      "faq.q3":"Can the Agent use my company's information?","faq.a3":"Yes. The Agent only speaks using the project, pricing, payment plan and portfolio data you upload — it never mixes in another company's data.",
      "faq.q4":"Does it replace my CRM?","faq.a4":"No. Your CRM stores your data; VERALIQ uses that data to talk with your customer in real time and drive the sales process. It integrates with your existing CRM.",
      "faq.q5":"Will it work on my own website?","faq.a5":"Yes. The same Agent can work across multiple environments — veraliq.com, your own website, your customer portal and your project site — one Agent, multiple channels.",
      "faq.q6":"Does it work on mobile?","faq.a6":"Yes. On mobile, the Agent's video and real-time voice conversation remain the core experience; admin users can also track Agents, leads and performance data from mobile.",
      "faq.q7":"Can it work with WhatsApp?","faq.a7":"Yes, WhatsApp is one of the supported channels; the Agent works consistently across web, WhatsApp and other channels with the same information.",
      "faq.q8":"Can it show my portfolio to customers?","faq.a8":"Yes. During the conversation, information cards such as price, payment plan, location, photos and project features can be shown on screen as needed.",
      "faq.q9":"Can Agents hand off tasks to each other?","faq.a9":"Yes. For example, when the greeting Agent notices an investment-focused customer, it can hand the task off to the investment advisor Agent — this hand-off is the foundation of the \"AI Department\" concept.",
      "faq.q10":"Does it replace the human sales team?","faq.a10":"Yes. The Agent runs the entire sales process itself, from first contact through closing; human involvement only comes in for matters you've defined as requiring authorization (e.g. discount approval). That's the whole point of VERALIQ: you don't need a separate human sales team.",
      "faq.q11":"Is my data safe?","faq.a11":"Yes. Company data is kept isolated (tenant isolation), access is controlled with role-based authorization, and data is processed following a data-protection approach.",
      "faq.q12":"How is it disclosed to users that the Agent is AI-powered?","faq.a12":"When relevant, the Agent explicitly states \"I am an AI digital sales agent powered by VERALIQ\"; this information is also stated on every Agent's card.",
      "contact.eyebrow":"GET IN TOUCH","contact.h2":"Let's build your on-the-ground sales team together.",
      "contact.p":"Let's design your own team around your projects. We'll set up a live demo running on your own data and show it to you.",
